1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,300
 Everyone tells you to invest in a Roth IRA in 2025, but no one actually shows you how to do it.

2
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:08,640
 Here's a 45-second step-by-step tutorial that you can save.

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:11,820
 1. Go to Schwa Fidelity or whatever you're comfortable with.

4
00:00:12,120 --> 00:00:13,280
 Click on Open an Account.

5
00:00:13,840 --> 00:00:14,940
 Click on Roth IRA.

6
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:17,580
 Fill out this form. It'll take 5 minutes.

7
00:00:18,020 --> 00:00:20,200
 2. Go to your dashboard and click on Transfer.

8
00:00:20,720 --> 00:00:23,280
 Connect your bank accounts and set up monthly recurring deposits.

9
00:00:23,500 --> 00:00:26,000
 I like to contribute $583 each month.

10
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:32,280
 For 2025, you can contribute up to $7,000 if you're under 50, or up to $8,000 if you're older.

11
00:00:32,680 --> 00:00:35,060
 3. Buy assets that are going to grow over time.

12
00:00:35,160 --> 00:00:38,320
 I like S&P 500 funds like VOO or any of these alternatives.

13
00:00:38,800 --> 00:00:44,700
 If you max out your Roth for the next 40 years, you'll have around $3 million with average returns, but that's not the crazy part.

14
00:00:45,080 --> 00:00:48,180
 You would have only put in $280,000 of your own money.

15
00:00:48,280 --> 00:00:51,480
 The extra $2 million is free money due to compound interest.

16
00:00:51,780 --> 00:00:53,820
 I'll talk more about this in my next livestream.

17
00:00:54,060 --> 00:00:56,620
 Tag your friend in the comments and I'll send you and your friend the link.

18
00:00:56,800 --> 00:00:57,280
 See you soon.

